# env files
.env*
# ...but the template is documentation, not a secret, and `.env*` was hiding it.
# The previously-tracked `env.example` (no dot) was deleted this round, which
# left the repo with no frontend env documentation at all.
!.env.example

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts